# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This technique has been used to lower the sampling cost of probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) for operator Loschmidt echo experiments with 56 qubits on an IBM Heron processor. [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Ginamit ang teknik na ito para pababain ang sampling cost ng probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) para sa mga operator Loschmidt echo experiment na may 56 qubit sa isang IBM Heron processor. [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

